  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Weather and Climate Services as Digital Public Goods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a pilot project which will be carried out in Malawi and Tanzania. The pilot project will explore the potential benefits of integrating Digital Public Goods innovation, such as yr.no, as a tool and mechanism for enhancing provision of weather and climate services in developing countries.</narrative>
  </description>
